	"Description": "Required Mods:\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1915]Content Patcher[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2400]SMAPI[/url]\n<br />[*]If using the [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/9246]Alternate Textures[/url]\uFEFF version, Content Patcher is not required\n<br />[/list]Current Features:\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]6 Color variations\n<br />[*]Replaces all cats with Minccino from Pokémon Black/White (CP version)\n<br />[*]All variations included in the AT version\n<br />[/list]Updates:\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]Fixed buggy animations\n<br />[*]Updated sprites to look more cute\n<br />[*]Fixed the manifest so SMAPI will no longer tell you to update when you are already using the newest version\n<br />[/list]\n<br />If you are using the Alternate Textures version, make sure you have scissors (purchasable from Robin) and use it on the cat (that sounds bad)\n<br />Please report any bugs you find so I can try and fix them! Also, if you have any requests (such as other\u00A0Pokémon I should make pets) then please let me know. :)\n<br />(I did not make the pixel art used in this mod, it was ripped from\u00A0Pokémon Black / White by Barubary, though slight edits were made by me)\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5255]DaisyNiko's Earthy Recolour[/url] used in screenshots",
